    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make every second count.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the high-stakes world of emergency medicine with <i>Paramedics!</i> <br> <br><strong>The first of its kind EMS simulator.</strong> <br>Experience the challenges of real emergency calls, master life-saving techniques, and navigate the unpredictable world of EMS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263530/extras/13e5b547f9f1ac465ffbea5714215f90.avif?t=1754675745\" /></span><br><strong><u>Realistic Medical Simulation</u></strong>   <br>Perform accurate and immersive medical procedures that test your skills and decision-making in critical scenarios.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Progress through the qualifications</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your virtual career in the EMS world, and with your earned points, obtain and pass qualifications to progress and expand your knowledge, as well as access BLS, ALS, and many other types of calls and equipment.<br> <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263530/extras/8a8b94dd3a9e44daeab7dc0a146b9b05.avif?t=1754675745\" /></span><strong><u>Full-body simulation </u></strong> <br>Using the Pulse Physiology Engine as the backbone with visual, auditory, and text-based scene representations.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Dynamic Emergencies &amp; Unpredictable Calls</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to scenarios where patient conditions change dynamically, requiring quick thinking and real-world medical strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Why Play Paramedics! - EMS Simulator?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263530/extras/bfcd7ac79663dc9864c8589270714d21.avif?t=1754675745\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Passion for Emergency Medicine</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love medical simulations and emergency response, `Paramedics! helps you explore the world of EMS while having fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Train Like a Future EMS Professional</u></strong><br>Considering a career as an EMT, paramedic, or first responder? Or already in the field? Paramedics! Provides an educational and challenging platform to hone your skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Early Development, Growing Potential</u></strong><br>This is just the beginning! Join us during early development and be part of the journey as Paramedics! Expands with new features, scenarios, and gameplay improvements.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make every second count.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the high-stakes world of emergency medicine with <i>Paramedics!</i> <br> <br><strong>The first of its kind EMS simulator.</strong> <br>Experience the challenges of real emergency calls, master life-saving techniques, and navigate the unpredictable world of EMS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263530/extras/13e5b547f9f1ac465ffbea5714215f90.avif?t=1754675745\" /></span><br><strong><u>Realistic Medical Simulation</u></strong>   <br>Perform accurate and immersive medical procedures that test your skills and decision-making in critical scenarios.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Progress through the qualifications</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your virtual career in the EMS world, and with your earned points, obtain and pass qualifications to progress and expand your knowledge, as well as access BLS, ALS, and many other types of calls and equipment.<br> <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263530/extras/8a8b94dd3a9e44daeab7dc0a146b9b05.avif?t=1754675745\" /></span><strong><u>Full-body simulation </u></strong> <br>Using the Pulse Physiology Engine as the backbone with visual, auditory, and text-based scene representations.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Dynamic Emergencies &amp; Unpredictable Calls</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to scenarios where patient conditions change dynamically, requiring quick thinking and real-world medical strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Why Play Paramedics! - EMS Simulator?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263530/extras/bfcd7ac79663dc9864c8589270714d21.avif?t=1754675745\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Passion for Emergency Medicine</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love medical simulations and emergency response, `Paramedics! helps you explore the world of EMS while having fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Train Like a Future EMS Professional</u></strong><br>Considering a career as an EMT, paramedic, or first responder? Or already in the field? Paramedics! Provides an educational and challenging platform to hone your skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Early Development, Growing Potential</u></strong><br>This is just the beginning! Join us during early development and be part of the journey as Paramedics! Expands with new features, scenarios, and gameplay improvements.</p>",
    "short_description": "First of its kind emergency medicine simulator, bringing the option for players around the world to try, learn, and experience what it takes to be in emergency medical services, featuring in-depth and real-life systems, and a responsive human body. You choose what protocols to follow.",
